{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inverta is a thrilling 2.5D puzzle-platformer where you defy gravity in a haunting post-apocalyptic world! Take control of gravity itself\u2014flip between surfaces, solve mind-bending puzzles, and uncover the dark secrets of a war-torn land. With innovative mechanics, atmospheric storytelling, and challenging gameplay, Inverta offers a unique adventure for fans of indie games, physics-based puzzles, and immersive platformers. Can you escape the ruins of a shattered world? Master gravity, conquer obstacles, and unravel the mystery!  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550930?t=1754555240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550930/398593c4bc281569a03c030390d94cc9e0002d64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754555240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550930/1e854f6bbab70a9bba4d18b8709243fab67eca46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754555240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550930/1e854f6bbab70a9bba4d18b8709243fab67eca46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754555240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inverta is a thrilling 2.5D puzzle-platformer where you defy gravity in a haunting post-apocalyptic world! Take control of gravity itself\u2014flip between surfaces, solve mind-bending puzzles, and uncover the dark secrets of a war-torn land. With innovative mechanics, atmospheric storytelling, and challenging gameplay, Inverta offers a unique adventure for fans of indie games, physics-based puzzles, and immersive platformers. Can you escape the ruins of a shattered world? Master gravity, conquer obstacles, an